  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的20%，所以在容器里剩下原有空气的80%或$\\frac{4}{5}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了得知活塞每作一次动作后容器内空气的压力，只要",
        "将活塞前一次动作后所指示出的空气压力的值乘以$\\frac{4}{5}$就行",
        "了. 依次指示出的容器内最初的空气压力的值，即活塞动作1",
        "次后、动作2次后、动作3次后等等的压力的值成等比数列，",
        "它的第1项等于750，公比等于$\\frac{4}{5}$. 活塞动作6次后空气压力",
        "的数值(以毫米汞柱为单位)是这个数列的第7项；这就是说，",
        "它等于积$750\\cdot\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通过计算后，得到",
        "$750\\cdot\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^6=\\frac{750\\times2^{12}}{5^6}=\\frac{750\\times4096}{5^6}=\\frac{24576}{125}\\approx197$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，活塞动作6次后，容器内空气的压力等于197毫米",
        "汞柱."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "278",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "278. 设$(x_n)$是等比数列，它的第1项等于$x_1$，公比等于$q$. 用",
        "$x_1$和$q$表示下列各项：",
        "а) $x_5$；　б) $x_{21}$；　в) $x_{150}$；　г) $x_m$；　д) $x_{m+2}$；　е) $x_{2k+1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "279",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "279. 在等比数列$(u_n)$里，$u_1=256$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$.",
        "求：а) $u_3$；　б) $u_5$；　в) $u_{10}$；　г) $u_n$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "280",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "280. 在等比数列$(b_n)$里，已知它的第1项$b_1$和公比$q$.",
        "求$b_n$，设：",
        "а) $b_1=96$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$，$n=7$；",
        "б) $b_1=0.125$，$q=-2$，$n=6$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
